{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128200012834-1128_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261128200012\"/><p>警員試圖制服野豬。</p><p>日本靜岡縣靜岡市清水區周五（27日）傍晚發生野豬闖入按摩店傷人事件，在店內和街上造成7人受傷。體長逾一米的野豬在周六（28日）上午捕殺，有獵人指牠的體重達100至120公斤，所有傷者均沒有生命危險。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T12:23:54.337433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T12:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T16:35:15.232365+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T12:17:29.756899+00:00","content_hash":"ef3aafef5984c99868634e84233f13a962b7328d161098d1b946dd7cc808b869","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}